# Merrimack County, NH — the county that governs 03255. Read 2026-08-20, NH Hunt.
#
# The county runs REVIZE (`/revize/plugins/...` in its own markup, and a
# `cms2.revize.com` admin link in the footer), which this repo already has an
# adapter for. Its own front page links 76 `.php` pages and it publishes NO
# sitemap and NO robots.txt — both 404 — so the front page's own link set IS
# the enumeration, which is rung 10 answered by rung 2.
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/board_of_commissioners_/index.php	Board of Commissioners
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/elected_officials/delegation/index.php	County Delegation (the NH House members from Merrimack County)
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/county_attorney/staff_directory.php	County Attorney
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/sheriff/staff_directory.php	Sheriff
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/register_of_deeds/staff_directory.php	Register of Deeds
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/administration/index.php	County Administration
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/finance/index.php	County Finance (Treasurer)
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/human_resources/index.php	County Human Resources
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/corrections/contact.php	Department of Corrections
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/nursing_home/meet_our_team.php	County Nursing Home
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/advocacy_center/index.php	Child Advocacy Center
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/facilities/index.php	County Facilities
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/departments/purchasing/index.php	County Purchasing
https://www.merrimackcounty.net/cities___town/index.php	The county's own list of its cities and towns
